#modname "Disable Vanilla MA 1.1"
#description "A simple mod packaged with Sombre Warhammer which moves all the Middle Age vanilla nations into the Early Age. This is intended to allow people to play games with random nations where they only get Warhammer Nations, not vanilla nations.

Compatibility: Should be compatible with any mod that doesn't use the base game MA nation IDs (except the One Age Mod, obviously)"
#icon "disableicon.tga"

#version 1.1

